WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:05.180
(upbeat orchestral music)
(audience cheering)

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:09.240
[Andy] Coming to you from
the historic Largo Theater

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:12.133
in Hollywood, it's Conan!

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:14.840
I'm Andy Richter.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.653
Tonight, Will Ferrell!

00:00:17.557 --> 00:00:20.260
Now, here he is!

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:24.763
Conan O'Brien!
(audience applauding)

00:00:27.834 --> 00:00:30.001
(silence)

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:41.200
Hey. Conan O'Brien here.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.570
Let me briefly explain where I am.

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:48.070
Right now I'm sitting in
the iconic Largo Theater.

00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:49.890
Why am I here?

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:52.850
Well, a lotta theaters across the country

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:56.720
are struggling right now,
and we really wanted to help

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:00.050
one of the local empty
theaters here in Los Angeles.

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:03.350
So we chose Largo.

00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:06.150
Largo's a very special place to everyone

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:08.450
in the Los Angeles comedy community.

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:10.720
Just about everybody's performed here.

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:15.330
And here's a fun fact: I
started here doing improv.

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:20.270
That's right, I got my
first laughs here in 1985.

00:01:20.270 --> 00:01:25.200
And got my last laughs here in 1991.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:29.713
No laughs since. Bit of
a drought. (chuckles)

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:34.400
No, me laughing at myself doesn't count.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:37.210
Anyway, let me assure you we are following

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:40.220
all of the health protocols
while we're here at the Largo.

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:43.180
I'm here with a bare-bones crew.

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:46.240
Everyone's wearing a mask,
everyone's socially distanced,

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:48.940
and the theater itself
is completely empty.

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:51.790
In fact, the only person
sitting here tonight

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:54.133
is my assistant Sona.

00:01:55.290 --> 00:01:56.589
Hey Sona!

00:01:56.589 --> 00:01:58.260
[Sona] Hi!

00:01:58.260 --> 00:01:59.520
[Conan] How's it goin'?

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:00.470
[Sona] All right.

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:06.080
See, I'm gonna feed off Sona's energy.

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:09.890
I'm gonna take that energy
and ride it like a wave,

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:13.793
and that's gonna give me the
energy I need to entertain you.

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:16.900
And you know, there's
another reason, actually,

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:18.610
that we moved locations.

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:21.330
Like a lotta people across the
country, probably like you,

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:25.830
I've been inside my home with
my family for months now,

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:29.060
and I thought it would be
nice to kinda switch it up.

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:32.160
So this is actually my
first time away from my wife

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:34.510
since the quarantine started.

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:36.690
So I just wanna briefly check in,

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:38.869
see how she's doing without me.

00:02:38.869 --> 00:02:42.536
♪ He's gone, he's gone,
he's finally gone ♪

00:02:42.536 --> 00:02:45.136
[Conan's Wife] (laughing) Woo-hoo!

00:02:45.136 --> 00:02:49.658
Oh, thank god! (cackles)

00:02:49.658 --> 00:02:51.290
Oh.

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:54.560
Well, she'll cheer up
eventually. (chuckles)

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:58.350
Anyway, given everything
that's happening right now

00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:01.530
on our planet, just...

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:03.230
We're dealing with a lot.

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:06.880
Let's face it: Sometimes
you just need to escape.

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:10.780
Well, luckily, our newest
sponsor has you covered.

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:11.613
Take a look.

00:03:11.613 --> 00:03:13.560
[Reporter] A heartbreaking milestone.

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:17.420
Nearly 100,000 lives lost
to the coronavirus pandemic.

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:20.365
[Reporter] Killer hornets
invading the U.S. and Canada.

00:03:20.365 --> 00:03:23.095
(grenades booming)
(crowd yelling)

00:03:23.095 --> 00:03:25.782
(somber music)

00:03:25.782 --> 00:03:26.615
(record scratches)

00:03:26.615 --> 00:03:28.390
[Narrator] Wanna get away? Now you can.

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:31.480
SpaceX will soon be offering
trips to outer space.

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:33.220
SpaceX.

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:35.930
You are now free to leave this hellhole.

00:03:35.930 --> 00:03:38.410
Thank you, good people at SpaceX.

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:39.950
Anyway, we got a great show tonight.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:42.640
Will Ferrell is gonna be joining us.

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:44.810
Excited about that, Sona?

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:45.643
[Sona] Yeah.

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:48.843
Will Ferrell.

